* text=auto eol=lf

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown
*.php diff=php

/.github export-ignore
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore
.styleci.yml export-ignore

# ── GitHub Linguist Overrides ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Mencegah GitHub menghitung file-file berikut sebagai bahasa utama proyek.
# Folder ini adalah tools/dependency, bukan kode aplikasi.

# Python virtual environment & load testing tools
.venv-locust/**         linguist-vendored
loadtests/**            linguist-vendored
requirements-loadtest.txt linguist-documentation

# Temporary dependency folders
.codex_tmp/**           linguist-vendored
tmpdeps/**              linguist-vendored
wheels/**               linguist-vendored

# Frontend node_modules (jaga-jaga jika ter-track)
frontend/node_modules/** linguist-vendored
